### MongoDB / Document → ORM (paradigm shift)

When migrating off Mongo to relational:

1. Replace Mongoose with Prisma/TypeORM/Sequelize.
2. Convert nested document fields to either joined child tables (1-N) or `JSONB`/`JSON` columns when access is whole-document.
3. Translate `ObjectId` → `UUID` (preferred) or `BIGINT`.
4. Replace aggregation pipelines with SQL (window functions, CTEs).
5. Replace `populate()` with `JOIN`s or eager-loading API.
6. Replace change streams with logical replication / CDC / triggers.

